## English (U.S.) — sections that change

**Promotional text (170):** Sixteen films live in the viewfinder, and a community with daily themes: post three days running for Porto 400, seven and fourteen for limited rolls never sold.  ←160 字符

**Replace "SHARE IT, KEEP IT":**
SHARE IT
Share a picture as it is, as a short before-and-after video, or as a "your turn" letter: the picture in a clear sleeve beside its roll, with a line for a friend.

**New section, after it:**
A COMMUNITY OF FILM PICTURES
Open the camera bag to the Community: a theme for the day and one for the week, and everyone's pictures in a clear-sleeve album. Sign in with Apple, post one you took with Koco, and leave a line under others'. Every picture and comment is looked at before it shows, and anything can be reported or its author blocked. Post on three days running and Porto 400 is yours; seven and fourteen days earn Dusk 200 and Ember 400, limited rolls that are never sold.

**"TRY BEFORE YOU BUY", last sentence:** The limited rolls come only from the community.

**Replace "PRIVATE BY DESIGN":**
PRIVATE BY DESIGN
Your pictures are developed and kept on your iPhone, in a Koco album in Photos. Only what you choose to post to the community leaves it, without its location. No ads, no tracking. You can delete your community account at any time.

